  "title": "VL53L4CX supply voltage and I2C voltage requirements",
  "content": "<p>Dear All,</p><p>I have a query regarding VL53L4CX voltage requirements. The data sheet mentions the typical voltage for AVDD is 2.8 and for IOVDD is 1.8V/2.8V</p><p>There is no separate IOVDD pin for VL53L4CX isn't it. So the I2C lines work with 1.8V MCU voltage also with AVDD and AVDDVCSEL at 3.3V? </p><p>Thank you,</p><p>Ravi</p>",
